{
  "version": 1,
  "about": [
    "THE key-match rule, as data: which rows of a schema-key column a combo",
    "value selects. Owner: scifor.keys (series_mask for pandas columns;",
    "numeric_mask / text_mask for MATLAB's described columns). Readers:",
    "  python  scifor/tests/test_key_match_cases.py (series_mask directly)",
    "  matlab  scimatlab/tests/matlab/scifor/TestKeyMatchCases.m (end to end:",
